# One line ending for everyone. Windows' core.autocrlf used to decide this per
# machine, which is why the same shared header read as a whole-file diff between
# two plugins. Text is LF in the repo AND in the working tree, so a checkout on
# any OS produces byte-identical files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
